Use code with caution.Note: I used a clean, free green gear/matrix icon URL placeholder for your app icon. You can replace that link with your own custom image URL later if you want.⚙️ 2. Create a file named service-worker.jsCreate a second new file in your GitHub repository and name it exactly service-worker.js. Paste this simple script inside to satisfy your phone browser's installation criteria:javascriptconst CACHE_NAME = 'freedom-hub-v1';
const ASSETS = ['/index.html', '/manifest.json'];

self.addEventListener('install', (event) => {
    event.waitUntil(
        caches.open(CACHE_NAME).then((cache) => cache.addAll(ASSETS))
    );
});

self.addEventListener('fetch', (event) => {
    event.respondWith(
        caches.match(event.request).then((response) => response || fetch(event.request))
    );
});
